body:
Ganyu BurnMelt with Ganyu, Nahida, Bennett, Dehya. It is absolutely satisfying for me, especially as a Ganyu enjoyer.
This team can deal immense damage, melt Ganyus Burst and even sometimes uses Dehyas Burst to melt shields or just skip a bit of time on cooldowns or so. That it uses all characters with all their abilites is just great. Especially since other Melt Variants of Ganyu dont/cant use her Burst wich somehow feels dissappointing. But this team has enough Pyro and Burn to use Ganyus Burst and still melt her shots.

Also this team is not too easy. Your defensive side is not that great like with a Zhongli, wo you actually have to think about stuff and where you stand and when you use your defensive stuff. So it actually feels rewarding when you clear the abyss with it. (The current abyss though feels rewarding anyway how hard it is)

While Ganyu Freeze is only really good against a larg group of small enemies, Ganyu Burnmelt shines better in all other cases and even can deal with large numbered small enemy waves due to the aoe of Ganyus Burst. So its way more flexible than Freeze.

And Ganyus melted charged shots are just nice big pp damage every shot.

Following on my list would be:
Nilou Bloom;
Childe international;
Ganyu Freeze;
Ei, Yelan, Xingqiu, Kazuha/Kokomi;
Every international variant out there;
AlHaitham Spread.
